7-r118</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Garcia de la Nava</surname><given-names>Jorge</given-names></name><name><surname>van Hijum</surname><given-names>Sacha</given-names></name><name><surname>Oswaldo</surname><given-names>Trelles</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>PreP: gene expression data pre-processing</article-title><source>Bioinformatics</source><year>2003</year><volume>19</volume><fpage>2328</fpage><lpage>2329</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14630668</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/bioinformatics/btg318</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Quackenbush</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Microarray data normalization and transformation</article-title><source>Nat Genet</source><year>2002</year><volume>32</volume><fpage>496</fpage><lpage>501</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12454644</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/ng1032</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dudoit</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Yang</surname><given-names>YH</given-names></name><name><surname>Luu</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Speed</surname><given-names>TP</given-names></name></person-group><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Bittner YML</surname></name></person-group><article-title>Normalization for cDNA microarray data</article-title><source>Proceedings of SPIE</source><year>2001</year></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Yang</surname><given-names>YH</given-names></name><name><surname>Dudoit</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Luu</surname><given-names>P</given-name